{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-7-1:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_7_1\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block-v2-n-7-1-001\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"筛选期与基线评估\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block-v2-n-7-1-002\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"筛选期自受试者签署知情同意书开始，至完成入排标准确认并随机化前结束。筛选期用于资格评估、基线评估和背景治疗稳定性确认。所有筛选评估日期和结果需记录。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block-v2-n-7-1-003\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"基线评估包括：记录稳定背景鼻用激素使用情况；双侧鼻息肉评分（NPS）、鼻塞VAS（0～10 cm）、SNOT-22、Lund-Kennedy内镜评分；以及完成入排标准确认和随机分层所需信息。基线评估必须与 SoA 保持一致。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block-v2-n-7-1-004\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"筛选评估异常时，可在随机化前重复相关评估以确认资格；重复评估的日期、结果和最终入排判断需记录。不得通过重复评估规避入排标准或修改随机分层因素。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"552d67603e5d2c3e175a97c211a27a8a50f884ae3f6f835ecc07b1398b9657a0"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:0d70415f53bbc25fd73f6ac8f78e8c48e919357a9f2df9046f184b45e921d004:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:0d70415f53bbc25fd73f6ac8f78e8c48e919357a9f2df9046f184b45e921d004:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"5b107d544049c47c41c14114d9e90d9ff265bacf97fb87b53b74201be1917266","prompt_sha256":"47dd66c834319411962b91127cd952207cccdab4dee7068a9ab81409e5aefa1e","provider_session_id":"3e9d6c7a-ee56-4e06-a536-5116e7